{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03195","headline":"游废观 · 杨炯","name":"游废观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青幛倚丹田，荒凉数百年。\n犹知小山桂，尚识大罗天。\n药败金炉火，苔昏玉女泉。\n岁时无壁画，朝夕有阶烟。\n花柳三春节，江山四望悬。\n悠然出尘网，从此狎神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}